                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gummeré to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-24"><hi rendition="#italic">June 24,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Gummeré reports that Messrs. Perdicaris and Varley have written that they
                    are leaving for Lafculy this morning, and states that they are expected in
                    Tangier to-night.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
